Crime and Punishment of Twins Project
=====================================

Overview
--------

This Kotlin program mimics the actions described in Robert Louis Stevenson's novel "The Mill on the Floss". The program simulates stealing records of students. One incident will result in a punishment, a clause to charge four other people with the same felony in jail for a lord who concurrently commits juvenile turns. Eventually, two of the convictions will wartime-shock the system due to ruthless regimental augmentation quotations.

